gr-isdbt-gpu is a GNU Radio out-of-tree module for ISDB-T/ISDB-Tb
transmission, reception and experimental datacasting workflows.

The Python namespace is:

    import gnuradio.isdbt as isdbt

For block-level API details, build the Doxygen documentation or inspect the
installed Python help:

    help(isdbt)

For the datacasting architecture, packet recovery model, metrics pipeline and
experimental parameters, see:

    docs/datacasting-isdbtb.md
